cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the CFR paper and the version of the software used."
type: software
title: "CounterFactual Retrieval (CFR)"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
abstract: >-
  Code for CounterFactual Retrieval for Evidence-Aware Individual Animal
  Identification, providing CFR and SSI metrics and an evaluation framework
  for evidence-aware animal re-identification. The evaluation compares full,
  foreground, background, and silhouette views to assess the evidence used
  for individual identification. The repository includes retrieval and
  robustness evaluation scripts, experiment configurations, and supporting
  mask-generation and download tools.
